OL,3,CDonald Trump set for two-day Ireland
OL,4,Cvisit in September
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump will visit
OL,7,FIreland for at least two days from
OL,8,FSeptember 12, it is understood.
OL,10,FThe trip will include a visit to Co
OL,11,FClare, where he is expected to attend
OL,12,Fthe Irish Open golf tournament at his
OL,13,Fcourse in Doonbeg.
OL,15,FHe is also expected to visit Dublin,
OL,16,Fbut details on many elements of the
OL,17,Fengagement have yet to be finalised.
OL,19,FThe final day of the Irish Open is
OL,20,FSeptember 13.
