OL,3,CDonald Trump set for two-day Ireland
OL,4,Cvisit in September
OL,6,FOn his last visit visit to Ireland in
OL,7,F2023, Mr Trump was warmly welcomed to
OL,8,FDoonbeg where locals waved American
OL,9,Fflags and some donned the Make America
OL,10,FGreat Again cap.
OL,12,FBut his last visit when he was in
OL,13,Foffice in 2019, sparked protests from
OL,14,Fclimate change, left-wing, pro-
OL,15,FPalestine, pro-choice, anti-racism and
OL,16,Fanti-war activists, who flew the Trump
OL,17,Fbaby blimp in Dublin.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/3
