OL,3,CDonald Trump set for two-day Ireland
OL,4,Cvisit in September
OL,6,FThe last visit of a sitting US
OL,7,FPresident to Ireland was by Joe Biden
OL,8,Fin 2023 to mark the 25th anniversary
OL,9,Fof the Good Friday Agreement.
OL,11,FMr Biden visited Belfast, Dublin, Co
OL,12,FLouth and Co Mayo, exploring his
OL,13,Fancestral links to the former and
OL,14,Fdeclaring "Mayo for Sam".
